<title>USA: Regis Corp names Marvin Goldstein COO.</title>
<headline>Regis Corp names Marvin Goldstein COO.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regis Corp said it named Marvin Goldstein chief operating officer.</p>
<p>Goldstein was formerly chief executive of Pet Food Warehouse Inc, the company said.  </p>
<p>The COO job is new at Regis, the largest U.S. owner and operator of hair salons.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
